sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Harness
    participant S as Session row
    participant T as Trigger
    participant Q as Promotion queue
    participant W as Python worker
    participant M as Oracle Agent Memory
    H->>S: UPDATE status = ENDED
    S->>T: AFTER UPDATE OF status
    T->>Q: chunk files marked promote_on_end
    Note over T,Q: same transaction
    W->>Q: read unconsumed chunks
    W->>M: remember, unless already known
    W->>Q: mark consumed
